<section class="wrap py-8">
  <%- include('../partials/breadcrumbs') %>
  <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Kalkulator kredytu hipotecznego</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-muted">Sprawdź, ile wyniesie rata przy różnym wkładzie własnym, okresie i oprocentowaniu. Porównaj raty równe i malejące.</p>
</section>
<section class="wrap pb-16" data-calc data-price="<%= price %>" data-full>
  <div class="grid overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-line lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="grid gap-6 bg-white p-6 sm:p-10">
      <label class="block"><span class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-semibold">Cena nieruchomości</span><b class="num" data-calc-v="price"></b></span><input type="range" min="100000" max="3000000" step="10000" value="<%= price %>" data-calc-in="price" class="mt-2 w-full"></label>
      <label class="block"><span class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-semibold">Wkład własny</span><b class="num" data-calc-v="down"></b></span><input type="range" min="10" max="60" value="20" data-calc-in="down" class="mt-2 w-full"></label>
      <label class="block"><span class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-semibold">Okres kredytowania</span><b class="num" data-calc-v="years"></b></span><input type="range" min="5" max="35" value="25" data-calc-in="years" class="mt-2 w-full"></label>
      <label class="block"><span class="flex justify-between text-sm"><span class="font-semibold">Oprocentowanie roczne</span><b class="num" data-calc-v="rate"></b></span><input type="range" min="3" max="11" step="0.05" value="6.9" data-calc-in="rate" class="mt-2 w-full"></label>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted">Symulacja ma charakter poglądowy i nie jest ofertą banku. Nie uwzględnia prowizji, ubezpieczeń ani zmian stóp procentowych.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 bg-navy-900 p-6 text-white sm:p-10">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-white/60">Rata równa (miesięcznie)</p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-display text-5xl font-extrabold num sm:text-6xl" data-calc-out>–</p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-4"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50">Kwota kredytu</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold num" data-calc-o="loan"></p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-4"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50">Suma odsetek</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold num" data-calc-o="interest"></p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-4"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50">Pierwsza rata malejąca</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold num" data-calc-o="decFirst"></p></div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-4"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-white/50">Odsetki – raty malejące</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-semibold num" data-calc-o="decInterest"></p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6"><div class="flex h-3 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10"><div class="bg-teal-400" data-calc-bar></div><div class="flex-1 bg-orange-400"></div></div>
          <div class="mt-2 flex justify-between text-xs text-white/55"><span>Kapitał</span><span>Odsetki</span></div></div>
      </div>
      <a href="/sprzedaz/mieszkania" class="btn btn-accent w-full">Szukaj mieszkań w tym budżecie</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
